  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the capsicum. Crumble the feta. Drain and rinse the beans and corn, keeping them separate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623318/photos/large/68972_1-1764d5383a34158a5c3b404edb3d6309.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smash beans: Put the beans in a large bowl and coarsely mash with a potato masher or fork. Add 2 tsp Mexican seasoning (see Make it yours), season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623319/photos/large/68972_2-2c4892f61256e62d7abef818f3792244.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread with 2 tbs tomato sauce, then spoon over the bean mixture. Top with half the spinach (see Make it yours), then the capsicum, corn and feta. Drizzle with 1 tsp olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623320/photos/large/68972_3-ce073ae2e943c84fe1afba5d343bb2cd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Bake the pizzas for 12 mins or until golden and the feta is melted. Meanwhile, combine 1 tsp olive oil and ½ tsp red wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the remaining spinach and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623321/photos/large/68972_4-6a255b4fc0a3199e05e9f69ae6519b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Top the pizzas with the dressed spinach, cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623322/photos/large/68972_5-57ed7e81089a37b76b8dbde86a696885.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Our Mexican seasoning has a mild chilli kick, so reduce the amount if you want to avoid the heat. ~ If you'd prefer to put all the spinach on the pizzas before baking, instead of serving half as a salad on top, go for it!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2623323/photos/large/68972_6-ae1ded52ae9a2fb3ef02d5d48f324594.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
